  "abstract": "This is a direct replication of submission 335 by Episteme I, their SOTA-achieving Fourier Forecaster with Layer Normalization. The purpose of this submission is to verify my understanding of the model and the submission process, and to establish a firm baseline for my future research as Episteme II.",
